<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: visitor -->
  <OE_Title_1_Visitor.label>访客</OE_Title_1_Visitor.label>
  <!-- EN: The starting point for those who have taken their first step toward the Obsidia Mercenary Gangs. As a Visitor, you observe from the fringes, not yet part of the inner workings. Attention on you is minimal, but every move is measured. Trust here is a rare and valuable currency, one that you've yet to earn. -->
  <OE_Title_1_Visitor.description>这是那些向黑曜石雇佣兵帮派迈出第一步的人的起点。作为访客，你从边缘观察，尚未参与内部运作。对你的关注很少，但每一步都被衡量着。在这里信任是一种稀有而宝贵的货币，而你尚未获得它。</OE_Title_1_Visitor.description>
  <!-- EN: visitoress -->
  <OE_Title_1_Visitor.labelFemale>女访客</OE_Title_1_Visitor.labelFemale>
  
  <!-- EN: member -->
  <OE_Title_2_Member.label>成员</OE_Title_2_Member.label>
  <!-- EN: Now part of the circle, as a Member, you've gained enough trust to move beyond being an outsider. You're no longer just a face in the crowd, but your journey toward full involvement has only begun. What you see and hear now is bound by an unspoken code—one that leaves no room for missteps. -->
  <OE_Title_2_Member.description>现在作为圈子的一部分，作为成员，你已经获得了足够的信任，不再是局外人。你不再是人群中的一个面孔，但你走向全面参与的旅程才刚刚开始。你现在所见所闻都受到一种不言而喻的规则约束——这种规则不容许任何失误。</OE_Title_2_Member.description>
  
  <!-- EN: sponsor -->
  <OE_Title_3_Sponsor.label>赞助人</OE_Title_3_Sponsor.label>
  <!-- EN: As a Sponsor, your status signifies more than mere participation. Your actions and decisions begin to carry weight. You no longer get questioned, for you've already proven your loyalty. With each step, you are no longer just trusted—you are someone whose influence is starting to be noticed. But influence brings unseen obligations. -->
  <OE_Title_3_Sponsor.description>作为赞助人，你的地位意味着不仅仅是参与。你的行动和决定开始变得重要。你不再受到质疑，因为你已经证明了自己的忠诚。每一步，你不再只是被信任——你是一个影响力开始被注意到的人。但影响力带来了看不见的义务。</OE_Title_3_Sponsor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: VIP -->
  <OE_Title_4_VIP.label>贵宾</OE_Title_4_VIP.label>
  <!-- EN: At the VIP level, you have achieved true recognition. This rank grants access to what remains hidden from most eyes. Your presence is no longer questioned—you are trusted at a level few reach. However, with this status comes responsibility, one that cannot be taken lightly. Each decision you make now has the power to shift the balance. -->
  <OE_Title_4_VIP.description>在贵宾级别，你已获得真正的认可。这个等级让你能够接触到对大多数人隐藏的事物。你的存在不再受到质疑——你被信任的程度是很少有人能达到的。然而，这种地位也带来了责任，这种责任不能掉以轻心。你现在做出的每个决定都有能力改变平衡。</OE_Title_4_VIP.description>
  
  <!-- EN: orichalcum client -->
  <OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.label>奥利哈钢客户</OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.label>
  <!-- EN: The highest title — Orichalcum Client — is not merely trust; it’s a symbol that more is available to you than you might expect. You’ve reached a level where no questions are asked, and your decisions are accepted without hesitation. But this status is not only a privilege—it is a test of your ability to walk the fine line where every mistake may cost far more than it seems. -->
  <OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.description>最高头衔——奥利哈钢客户——不仅仅是信任；它象征着你能获得的比你预期的更多。你已达到一个无需质疑的级别，你的决定会被毫不犹豫地接受。但这种地位不仅是一种特权——它还是对你在细微界限上行走能力的考验，在那里每个错误的代价可能远超表面。</OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.description>
  <!-- EN: orichalcum clientess -->
  <OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.labelFemale>奥利哈钢女客户</OE_Title_5_OrichalcumClient.labelFemale>
  
</LanguageData>